# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1264
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_dec204cd:

    # "The arena was drenched in blood as the Caltrack flailed; bodies and torn limbs littered the ground as people screamed."
    "闘技場は血濡れとなり、カルトラックが暴れまわる。地面には遺体と千切れた手足が散らばり、人々の悲鳴が響いていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1265
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8a00a866:

    # "Even Sypha, usually smug and composed, was barking orders."
    "普段は傲岸不遜で冷静なシファでさえ、命令を大声で言っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1266
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_6fc3a72a:

    # "Staggering, bleeding, forcing the others to keep moving and fight."
    "よろめきながら、血を流しながら、仲間に前進と戦いを強いる。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1267
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_9d245642:

    # "Now, with the Caltrack's eyes fixed on her, Sypha's pupils widened; for the first time, I saw fear in her face."
    "今、カラトラックの目が彼女に注がれると、サイファの瞳孔が開いた。私は初めて、彼女の顔に恐怖を見た。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1268
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8a29f88d:

    # "Any moment, it would come crashing down on her and her exhausted body wouldn't move in time..."
    "今にも、それは彼女の上に崩れ落ちてきて、疲れ切った体は間に合わない…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1269
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_3226ef70:

    # "{i}...But something moved inside me now.{/i}"
    "{i}…でも今、私の心の中で何かが動いた。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1270
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_b89032c8:

    # "I felt my whole body act on its own, rising as a hot surge of energy flooded through me."
    "意思とは別に全身が動き、熱いエネルギーがほとばしるのと同時に立ち上がっていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1271
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_42819c2d:

    # "{i}What was going on?{/i}"
    "{i}何が起こっているの？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1273
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_aeaf7911:

    # "Moments ago, I was dying, and now..."
    "さっきまで死にかけていたのに、今は…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1274
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_c8bf02ac:

    # "I sprang forward. Faster than before."
    "駆け出した。前よりも速く。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1275
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_ad41bb57:

    # "Faster than I'd ever moved."
    "今までで一番速く動いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1277
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_f01b3c92:

    # "With a single motion, I swept Sypha from the sand and yanked her clear of the snapping jaws."
    "一瞬の動作で、シファを砂の上からかき抱き、彼女を牙の間から引き離した。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1278
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8fa10aa1:

    # "She stared up at me, shock and disbelief warring in her eyes."
    "彼女は私を見上げてきた。瞳の中に戸惑いと疑念が渦巻いていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1279
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_e3fb0534:

    # "I set her down gently and turned back to the Caltrack."
    "優しく彼女を下ろし、振り返ってCaltrackの方へ向かった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1280
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_4cfa3603:

    # "It snapped one of its many jaws toward me."
    "幾つもの顎の一つを、こっちへ食らいついた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1281
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_bb5a2503:

    # "A quick pivot carried me past it."
    "素早い身のこなしでそれを躱し、通り過ぎた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1283
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_f96435af:

    # "A tentacle latched on and punched through the creature's cheek as I flung myself into the air, crashing down onto one of its heads and driving my claws through its eye."
    "触手がその生物の頬に食い込み、貫通した。私は空中へ飛び上がり、その一つの頭めがけて落下すると、爪を眼に突き立てた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1285
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8afbe17f:

    # "The beast bellowed, thrashing, a shriek so sharp the crowd clamped hands over ears."
    "獣が吼えながら暴れ、耳を貫くような金切り声に、観客が一斉に耳を覆った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1286
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_30842b18:

    # "{i}I wasn't controlling my limbs.{/i}"
    "{i}手足を制御できていなかった。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1287
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_86951371:

    # "{i}I didn't even know I *could* move like this.{/i}"
    "{i}こんな風に動けるものだとは、知りもしていなかった。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1288
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_3c70e601:

    # "{i}What was happening?{/i}"
    "{i}何が起こっていた？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1289
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8920d71f:

    # "I slid and rolled down, claws grinding through jelly and bone, carving the socket wide."
    "滑り落ちて転がりながら、爪がゼリーと骨を削り、眼窩を広く抉る。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1290
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8279394b:

    # "{i}Were my claws sharper?{/i}"
    "{i}私の爪はもっと鋭かっただろうか？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1291
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_87a7a085:

    # "{i}My muscles stronger?{/i}"
    "{i}俺の筋肉が強くなった？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1292
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_cc821a2e:

    # "Landing, I dragged my talons in a clean arc, severing the throat of one Caltrack head."
    "着地と同時に、鉤爪を引き裂くように振るった。無駄のない弧を描いて、一つのカルトラックの頭の喉を切り裂いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1293
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_aec21242:

    # "It staggered back, one head limp, the others panicking."
    "それはよろめきながら後ずさり、片方の首はぐったりと垂れ、残りの首は慌てふためいていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1296
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_fcfb1fa6:

    # "In a last, desperate lunge, it charged."
    "最後の、必死の突進を、仕掛けてきた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1297
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_f8420303:

    # "I moved like lightning, {i}no{/i}, like something beyond it, hurling myself with my tentacles, a straight shot that punched clean through the Caltrack's chest and burst out its spine, leaving a gaping hole in my wake."
    "瞬く間に、{i}いや{/i}、それ以上に、俺は触手を使って自らを射出した。一直線に、カルトラックの胸部を貫き、背骨を貫通して、その跡にはぽっかりと穴を開けた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1298
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_7c29366c:

    # "It's heads swayed in the air for a few moments, as though the creature itself was trying to understand what had just happened to it."
    "その首は空中で数秒間ゆっくりと揺れ動いた、まるで生き物自身が、今自分に起きたことを理解しようとしているかのように。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1301
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_0de8f749:

    # "The creature tumbled lifelessly forward, smashing its heads against the wall, twitching in final spasms."
    "その生物は生気なく前に倒れ込み、頭部を壁に打ち付け、最後の痙攣に震えていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1302
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_6af42d98:

    # "The crowds stared in stunned silence."
    "群衆は唖然とした沈黙で見つめていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1303
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_b1af4655:

    # "What had they just witnessed?"
    "いったい何を目撃したのだろう？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1304
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_5e9bc9b3:

    # "A monster that could fell armies not merely defeated but {i}eviscerated{/i}."
    "軍隊を倒すどころか、{i}ずたずたに引き裂いた{/i}魔物。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1305
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_075d7561:

    # "Destroyed by a perfect predator."
    "完璧なる捕食者に滅ぼされた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1306
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_987bf0f8:

    # "{i}A god of the arena.{/i}"
    "{i}闘技場の神{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1307
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_15e6e6c7:

    # "My arms lifted on their own, and a voice thundered that wasn't mine."
    "腕がひとりでに上がり、そして私のものでない声が轟いた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1309
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_ec319721:

    # SHYAHTAN "I AM SHYAHTAN! LORD OF A THOUSAND STARS, UNBOWED AND UNBROKED! BRING ME YOUR KINGS OF MEN AND PETTY GODS SO THEY MAY TREMBLE BEFORE ME!"
    SHYAHTAN "我こそはシャーダン!千星の主にして、不屈不撓の存在!人間どもの王も、小賢しき神々も連れて来い!我が前に震えおののかせるがよい!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1310
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_846ff733:

    # "The crowd was silent at first. Stunned."
    "群衆は最初、静かだった。
呆然として。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1311
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_a362b8b6:

    # "Then, a single fist rose, a single voice cheered..."
    "すると、一つの拳が挙がり、一つの声が上がり…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1312
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_a593dfce:

    # "And the stadium erupted."
    "そして、スタジアムは轟音と歓声に包まれた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1316
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_74cb7483:

    # "SHYAHTAN! SHYAHTAN! SHYAHTAN!"
    "シャーハタン!シャーハタン!シャーハタン!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1319
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_66a6a854:

    # "As I looked to the stands, I caught Celeste."
    "観客席を見やると、セレスティーヌが目に入った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1320
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_a959538b:

    # "Enthralled, leaning forward, her eyes wide as her hands clenched the fabric of her chair."
    "夢中で、身を乗り出して、
目を見開きながら椅子の布地を握りしめている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1321
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_7c770864:

    # "Flushed, lips parted, an excited breath escaped her."
    "頬を染めて、唇を開いて、興奮した息を漏らす。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1322
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_b4e1f66d:

    # "Sypha and the others hurried toward me; most wore pain and worry."
    "サイファたちは急いで私のもとへ駆け寄ったが、ほとんどが痛みと心配の表情を浮かべている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1323
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_4f701a79:

    # "Only Sypha smirked."
    "シファだけが薄笑いを浮かべた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1325
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_298515e0:

    # "And just like that, the power snapped out of me as control returned."
    "そうして、力が抜けると同時に、制御が戻ってきた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1331
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_9f03be0f:

    # "My legs gave way; I collapsed to the sand, the world blurring."
    "足の力が抜けて、私は砂の上に崩れ落ち、世界が霞んでいった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1332
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_45d3a970:

    # "Figures gathered, voices muffled, my name swallowed by the roar. Then darkness."
    "姿が集まり、声は途切れ、俺の名は轟音に吞み込まれて。そして闇。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1334
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_6751e97f:

    # "...In that darkness, I hear a familiar voice call to me."
    "…その暗闇で、懐かしい声が聞こえる。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1336
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_7884caad:

    # REGINA "...Poor, sweet baby."
    REGINA "…ああ、かわいそうな、甘い赤ちゃん。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1342
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_d41c0b74:

    # "My eyes open, and I find myself back home in my bedroom, the fire lit as I look around."
    "目を覚ますと、私は自分の部屋のベッドで、暖炉に火が灯っているのを確認しながら周りを見回していた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1343
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_9f9545d0:

    # "Outside the window I see... {i}stars.{/i}"
    "窓の外には…{i}星{/i}が見える。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1344
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_e0c35607:

    # "A deep black ocean of night sky and vibrant stars drifting by."
    "深黒き夜空の海と、漂う星々。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1345
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_0f7d22c1:

    # REGINA "You're growing stronger."
    REGINA "強くなっているな。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1349
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_86a97154:

    # MC @ angry "You...!"
    MC @ angry "お前…!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1350
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_e8ad6e7d:

    # MC @ angry "What do you want from me?"
    MC @ angry "何がほしいんだ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1351
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_7564923d:

    # REGINA @ talk "I sensed something awakening within you."
    REGINA @ talk "私はあなたの中に目覚めつつある何かを感じ取った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1352
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_edff5319:

    # REGINA @ sad "I was worried, I—"
    REGINA @ sad "心配したよ、私——"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1353
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_089cbfa2:

    # MC @ angry "Spare me your worry."
    MC @ angry "心配は無用だ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1354
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_6c557f09:

    # MC @ angry "I don't want it."
    MC @ angry "いらない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1355
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_07f65605:

    # REGINA @ sad "{i}*Sigh*{/i}"
    REGINA @ sad "{i}*ふう*{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1356
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_62852e5e:

    # REGINA @ sad "How many times must I apologize?"
    REGINA @ sad "何度謝ればいいの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1357
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_952564af:

    # MC @ angry "This isn't about a few coins I left lying around!"
    MC @ angry "これは私が置き忘れた数枚のコインの"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1358
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_8438e10f:

    # MC @ sad "You spent my and Erika's whole lives lying about {i}who{/i} you are."
    MC @ sad "あなたは私とエリカの人生すべてを、{i}誰{/i}であるかについて嘘をつき続けてきた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1359
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_22f1bda5:

    # MC @ sad "About {i}what{/i} you are."
    MC @ sad "あなたが{i}何{/i}であるかについて。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act2/TheBeastOfNovaras/scr_TheBeastOfNovaras.rpy:1360
translate ja qst_TheBeastOfNovaras_FlashbackOverCaltrackFinish_0b7b563e:

    # REGINA @ sad "I have spent most of my life on the run."
